<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>500 | System Interruption</title>
    
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            color: white;
            margin: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;      /* Vertical Center */
            justify-content: center;   /* Horizontal Center */
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .error-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        .glow-red {
            position: absolute;
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); 
            filter: blur(100px);
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: -1;
        }
        pre::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 4px; }
        pre::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 10px; }
        
        /* Centering Logic for the Watermark */
        .watermark-center {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="glow-red top-1/4 left-1/4"></div>
    <div class="glow-red bottom-1/4 right-1/4"></div>

    <div class="px-6 w-full flex justify-center">
        <div class="error-card rounded-[2.5rem] p-10 md:p-16 text-center relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
            
            <div class="watermark-center text-[180px] font-black tracking-tighter leading-none text-white/5 italic select-none">
                500
            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10">
                <div class="h-16 w-16 bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
                    ⚠️
                </div>

                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-4 italic">
                    System <span class="text-gray-500 font-light not-italic">Interruption</span>
                </h1>

                <p class="text-gray-400 font-medium mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                    Something went wrong within the academic core. Our systems are currently investigating the anomaly.
                </p>

                <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-10 text-left">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-3">Diagnostic Trace</p>
                    <pre class="text-xs text-red-400/80 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
<%= (typeof error === 'object' && error !== null) ? (error.message || error.toString()) : (error || 'Internal system error logged.') %>
                    </pre>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="/" 
                       class="bg-white text-black px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-gray-200 transition-all active:scale-95">
                        Return Home
                    </a>
                    
                    <a href="/dashboard" 
                       class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
                        Dashboard
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/5">
                <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-[0.4em]">RIT AcadeMIA Terminal</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>